 144+ 7542              //       that is normally FORTH, For example ASSEMBLER points FORTH's null-word
 145+ 7542              // PFA+6 is the pointer that builds up the vocabulary linked list.
 146+ 7542              //       FORTH has 0 here to signal the end of the list and user's variable
